id: pm-tom5xp
title: "GH-839: extension field declarations accept types the persisted schema cannot validate"
description: Unify extension-registered custom field types with the authoritative persisted schema field vocabulary so unsupported declarations fail at authoring or registration rather than later mutation.
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 1
