author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: "Export a documented closed custom-field type union through the public SDK; Reject unsupported extension field declarations at registration with actionable diagnostics; Document persistence and union-merge behavior for every supported field type; Cover type-level, runtime, CLI, package-author, and packed-consumer behavior"
parent: pm-8jdc
risk: medium
confidence: high
reporter: github
severity: medium
environment: "pm-cli 2026.7.29, Node 22"
expected_result: "SDK types, runtime registration, CLI schema commands, merge semantics, and documentation expose one authoritative custom-field type contract."
actual_result: "SchemaFieldDefinition.type is unconstrained while pm schema add-field accepts only string, number, boolean, and string_array."
component: SDK extension schema contracts
